00:59:26.600 --> 00:59:31.190
<v Nevaeh>I don't understand why that's so difficult to just, like, hand it over to me.
<v Nevaeh>我不明白为什么仅仅把它交给我这么困难。

00:59:31.190 --> 00:59:36.190
<v Emanuele Berry>I'm Emanuele Berry. Ira Glass will be back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Emanuele Berry>我是Emanuele Berry。Ira Glass下周将带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。
